```mdl
verdict createGame: Creation and rollback exist in createObject, but the state is not hidden and an unknown id is an invariant defect.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-game/src/capabilities/create-object.ts]
  note: |
    It is a `CreateObjectEntry.createObject` function, not an operation. It calls `variant.createVariant`, adds the
    state with `SpaceOperation.AddObject` to the same `target` as the Game with no hidden flag, then adds the Game
    and on failure invokes `RemoveObjects` for the state. An unregistered `variantId` fails
    `invariant(variant, ...)` rather than returning `UnknownVariant`. No test.
```

